  <String Id="ZaprettWarningDlg_Title" Value="zaprett Setup" />
  <String Id="ZaprettWarningDlgTitle" Value="{\WixUI_Font_Title}Before you install" />
  <String Id="ZaprettWarningDlgDescription" Value="How zaprett works and what an antivirus may notice" />
  <String Id="ZaprettWarningDlgText" Value="zaprett intercepts network packets with the WinDivert driver (from the zapret project) and alters them so that the provider's DPI does not recognise a blocked site. Nothing is sent to third-party servers and there is no telemetry.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Some antivirus products flag WinDivert and winws.exe as a hacking tool or a potentially unwanted application because the driver can intercept traffic. The engine files come unchanged from the official zapret releases and their checksums are verified at build time. If your antivirus removes them, add the zaprett install folder (C:\Program Files\zaprett by default) to its exclusions.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;GoodbyeDPI, another copy of zapret and other programs that use WinDivert must not run at the same time as zaprett." />
  <String Id="ZaprettWarningDlgTray" Value="Show the zaprett icon in the notification area at sign-in" />
</WixLocalization>
